flowchart LR
    Task[Official task instruction] --> Actor[Fresh Astra actor\nLive closed-loop policy]
    Source[Audited robotics source\nIsolated scratch workspace] <--> Actor
    Actor <--> F[F: typed hardware interface\nDescribe · read · act]
    Actor <--> B0[B0: native codebase interface\nObserve · step]
    Actor <--> B[B: native interface +\nimage-only Astra observer]
    F <--> Proxy[Shared execution proxy\nAction validation + sensor allowlist]
    B0 <--> Proxy
    B <--> Proxy
    Proxy -->|Native actions| Sim[Robot simulator\nLIBERO tested; RoboCasa being added]
    Sim -->|Cameras + robot sensors| Proxy
    Sim --> Evaluator[Private official success check\nAfter every native step]
    Proxy --> Log[Action + observation + usage logs]
    Log --> Replay[Independent replay audit\nSame reset and saved actions; zero model calls]
    Evaluator --> Replay
